{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "3bbe8d1a9f12c7d9072af2a145fde6465a53c67e177fc60d929e1f5dd26443dd", "ja": "勇気の一歩", "zh": "勇敢的一步", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "38917456a817bc8eba4304aaf973993351273e02c29bf2f7226afaecaf721452", "ja": "可憐の言葉を受け、静香と仲直りする千早。\n続いて謝ろうと昴を探していると、環と昴が\n話をしている場面に遭遇する。昴は千早に\n怒っていないと言うが、姉妹になるという話\nを、もう一度考え直してほしいと告げる。", "zh": "千早听了可怜的话，与静香和好如初。\n接着，她在寻找昴准备向她道歉时，撞见了\n环和昴正在交谈的场面。昴虽然对千早表示\n自己并没有生气，但还是希望千早能再重新\n考虑一下成为姐妹的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_05_1000_null", "source_sha256": "de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481", "ja": "翌日……", "zh": "隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_05_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "381cfccbecf74587b2f58d79ae25a6f01090d14e2ed62423f1e101e96aa8a4ae", "ja": "あの……今までのこと、ごめんなさいっ！\n上級生として、あるまじき態度だったわ……。", "zh": "那个……之前的事，对不起！\n我作为学姐，态度实在太不应该了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_05_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "38970819203c8ecdc1a5a4e2051904ecbc260b65fdbfc480082eb086ec758359", "ja": "い、いえ！　わたし、気にしてませんから。それに\nわたしも、高坂さんを驚かせたりしちゃったし……。", "zh": "没、没有啦！我不在意的。而且\n我也吓到高坂学姐了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_05_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "b77ae82fce5555b6865ff52ffb8ed588c5f470e3537d2f19d1b865f47821280d", "ja": "その後、誤解の解けた育は、高坂さんや\nミス・ラベンダーと改めて仲良くなれたようだった……", "zh": "在那之后，解开了误会的育，似乎和高坂同学\n还有薰衣草小姐重新搞好了关系……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_05_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "0690ef1545ff24a4abd14486d14eaa9d6cf4bc16c0a8175ed11b0ccae3f9af39", "ja": "静香……本当にごめんなさい。私、貴女を\n高坂さんにとられたみたいで、寂しかったの。", "zh": "静香……真的对不起。我因为感觉你像是被高坂小姐抢走了一样，很寂寞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_05_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "41041264ea5cf5fb98a9a55262a52b2accc263458f80b0521c433b043c269845", "ja": "私だって、お姉さまと姉妹になったばかりの頃は\nお姉さまに夢中で……貴女を放っていたのに。", "zh": "我也是，刚和姐姐结成姐妹的那段时间，整个人都沉浸在姐姐身上……却冷落了你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_05_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "d04455b7925e64f4fa2fbf522854b92befd1273df1bc4b58d24ed0e5cedcc514", "ja": "……もう、そんなことだろうと思ったわ。\n大体、何年の付き合いだと思ってるの？", "zh": "……我就知道会是这样。\n你觉得我们相识几年了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_05_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "daea4a4285ca82a4f738811bbbb6b15fc5ac1e68e45dbf069a6d4b208ec7e50d", "ja": "私も、色々無神経だったわ。\n……私のほうこそ、ごめんなさい。", "zh": "我也有很多地方太不体谅人了。……该道歉的是我才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_05_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "9fde8190c90d07802aa22d5ed3cd62123b8da83fe8063597fc174df42133f49b", "ja": "……静香。\nまた私とも、話してくれる？", "zh": "……静香。\n以后还能和我，多聊聊吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_05_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "6ff39f7b847344562798849bbe33ac6dc13b16739f44c8d713438212d08c6e5a", "ja": "当たり前でしょ。\n今日は久し振りに、一緒に帰りましょうか。", "zh": "那当然了。\n今天难得一起，要不要一起回去？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_05_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "f520fae57d73708f415bdf3e1ae9f271813fc57b5b061cc03401960e73ed9fbd", "ja": "……永吉さんに、謝りに行かないと。\nどこにいるのかしら……。", "zh": "……得去向永吉同学道歉才行。\n她会在哪里呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_05_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "e01757ce70f3c8c951ad7db43c92a3884f0280a2583641a2e2ac8d710f97667c", "ja": "そうだわ、聖歌隊の練習を休むって言わないと。\nいったん音楽室に……。", "zh": "对了，我得去说一声，我要请假不参加合唱队的练习。\n先去一趟音乐教室……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_05_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "911810927c67a0003d6381b77123628b7dab84289c1fc7ec308b64ea7582f0f0", "ja": "あっ……ち、千早さん……。", "zh": "啊……千、千早小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_05_1013_002chi", "source_sha256": "3d59a33094f2aec1026b0676abbfcaf2890e9c37aa070bb796bbd4ea7145917c", "ja": "……？　大神さん、すこしいいかしら？\n永吉さんと、ふたりで話がしたいの。", "zh": "……？大神同学，能耽误你一点时间吗？\n我想和永吉同学单独谈谈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_05_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "8397b7302e9fae6255394e04bdda866a64570153da90ac0fa6adb988ecf3c836", "ja": "っ……わかりました。\n失礼します……！", "zh": "……好的。\n失礼了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_05_1015_se", "source_sha256": "3acc3d8d20a36f0a3257a2150ed2ff29259cbfec1d7baf7c3ef5ae9411f0f515", "ja": "バタバタバタ……", "zh": "噔噔噔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_05_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "162acc2a41f2d03af324fdfcb92ffba771992e629aba1a8c4ce6402101f07d56", "ja": "あの……千早さん。\nわたしに話って……？", "zh": "那个……千早小姐。\n找我有什么事吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_05_1017_002chi", "source_sha256": "0e89fb90228b9983d9576b851fab05139e90a074929389ddc51f90a241543fc6", "ja": "……永吉さん、この前は本当にごめんなさい。\nあなたにひどいことを言ったわ。", "zh": "……永吉同学，之前真的很抱歉。\n我对你说了过分的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_05_1018_002chi", "source_sha256": "00549fe8b2ee9f76645f90399dc03c37de985429a74ab6dc508075798367adb7", "ja": "あれは、八つ当たりだったの。可憐お姉さまにも、\nはっきり言われたわ。本当にごめんなさい。", "zh": "那是我在迁怒你。可怜姐姐也明确地说过我了。真的很对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_05_1019_002chi", "source_sha256": "6dd16daca47e648966a028bd9cb6defa4dbe99b1e417a9c7422331c70aeb5c17", "ja": "お詫びに、どんなことでもするわ。\nそれで、あなたが許してくれるなら。", "zh": "作为赔礼，无论什么事我都愿意做。\n只要这样你能原谅我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_05_1020_047sub", "source_sha256": "cb14db00049658ea40a8434c400bfe120febcd50dce38e4e56467f2ace9d2aa8", "ja": "あ、あの。わたし、怒ってないので。というか、わたし\nが千早さんを怒らせちゃったんだと思ってたので……。", "zh": "啊，那个……我没有生气。应该说，我还以为是我惹千早小姐生气了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_05_1021_047sub", "source_sha256": "a29e5fb8b2783a04b2a27b4af693b61de1f8c70396b55457ad85ebd07c8f419e", "ja": "だから、許すとか、そういうのじゃないんですけど……\n聞いてもらえますか？", "zh": "所以，不是原不原谅的问题……你能听我说吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_05_1022_002chi", "source_sha256": "133c9c3a60f5940d9784546d0a00738e35a725a8e8e0c97a9062900d557c911a", "ja": "もちろんよ。", "zh": "当然可以。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_05_1023_047sub", "source_sha256": "ba2245e7c852b28a2d67861cc2bb13a719fa953e27b06ffb0618611ecfaa58c1", "ja": "あの。わたしと、姉妹になるっていう話……\nもう一度、考え直してほしいんです。", "zh": "那个。关于和我成为姐妹这件事……\n希望你能再重新考虑一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_05_1024_002chi", "source_sha256": "63b0a53cd81edf40031293fd128ba9d36729c27e83d913a1c83bcbf1dcfcab8a", "ja": "えっ……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_05_1025_047sub", "source_sha256": "833f8ca2c0d3d003949286c865e478eeee07d15c8bd75c6e6e2159aeffbcd0d2", "ja": "わたし、このまま千早さんと姉妹を続けていいのか、\nわからなくなってきちゃって……。", "zh": "我开始有点不知道，\n自己是不是真的该继续和千早姐做姐妹了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_05_1026_047sub", "source_sha256": "eabc48a87f85934c9e2b5a3018f61d9bbcfaa359a415655f439c6f9ff844bb98", "ja": "（大神さんに「本当に千早さんのことが好きなのか」\nって聞かれても、答えられなかった。だから……）", "zh": "（就算大神同学问我“是不是真的喜欢千早姐”，我也答不上来。所以……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_05_1027_047sub", "source_sha256": "a41ee4b2a5ac8f3dc134d80be1b93fee21265101be18f9ae319bdf8a320e4ec4", "ja": "だから千早さんも、考えてほしいんです。\n本当にわたしでいいのか。わたしも、考えますから。", "zh": "所以，也希望千早小姐能好好想一想。\n自己真正想要的，究竟是不是我。我也会好好想一想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_05_1028_002chi", "source_sha256": "89ba037c411de34281621b5cac889591ad723b0895390625fd5b17084bb7ac12", "ja": "……わかったわ。", "zh": "……我知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
